<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The mountains are His;</l><l>The valleys are His;</l><l>The stars are His handiwork, too.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Our God is so big,</l><l>So strong, and so mighty—</l><l>There’s nothing our God cannot do.</l><l>That’s right!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
